Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,这间房子土地宽40尺\N{\fs48\bord3\c&H00E6FF&}Rumah ini lebar 40 kaki.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.14,0:00:06.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,已有样板屋，前面门廊非常大\N{\fs48\bord3\c&H00E6FF&}Sudah ada rumah contoh, porch depan memang besar.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.71,0:00:09.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,建筑面积：宽29尺\N{\fs48\bord3\c&H00E6FF&}Build-up rumah 29 kaki,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.86,0:00:14.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,长32尺\N{\fs48\bord3\c&H00E6FF&}panjangnya 32 kaki.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.24,0:00:17.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,这是样板屋\N{\fs48\bord3\c&H00E6FF&}Ini showroom dia.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.00,0:00:18.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,真的很漂亮！\N{\fs48\bord3\c&H00E6FF&}Memang cantik!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.71,0:00:21.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,楼下有一间房 + 储藏室\N{\fs48\bord3\c&H00E6FF&}Bawah ada satu bilik dan stor.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.95,0:00:23.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,浴室\N{\fs48\bord3\c&H00E6FF&}Bilik air.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.48,0:00:25.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,厕所\N{\fs48\bord3\c&H00E6FF&}Tandas.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.10,0:00:26.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,这是厨房\N{\fs48\bord3\c&H00E6FF&}Ini kitchen dia.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:27.00,0:00:29.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,这是半独立式洋房\N{\fs48\bord3\c&H00E6FF&}Ini rumah semi-D.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.95,0:00:33.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,屋后有地，旁边也有地\N{\fs48\bord3\c&H00E6FF&}Belakang rumah ada tanah, tepi pun ada tanah.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.67,0:00:35.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,后面10尺\N{\fs48\bord3\c&H00E6FF&}Belakang 10 kaki.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.19,0:00:37.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,侧边还有10尺地\N{\fs48\bord3\c&H00E6FF&}Tepi pula ada 10 kaki tanah.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.86,0:00:40.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,配SPC地板\N{\fs48\bord3\c&H00E6FF&}Lantai SPC disediakan.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:40.90,0:00:43.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,楼上有家庭厅\N{\fs48\bord3\c&H00E6FF&}Atas ada satu family hall.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.05,0:00:46.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,第二间房，独立厕所\N{\fs48\bord3\c&H00E6FF&}Bilik kedua, tandas sendiri.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.43,0:00:48.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,第三间房也有独立厕所\N{\fs48\bord3\c&H00E6FF&}Bilik ketiga pun ada tandas sendiri.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.33,0:00:51.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,所以这是 4房4厕\N{\fs48\bord3\c&H00E6FF&}Jadi rumah ini 4 bilik, 4 tandas,
